    "status": "OPERATIONAL",
    "description": "BarnDog is a unique experience for your dog. It is a place where your dog can be a reaI dog, doing dog activities all day. We play from sunup to sundown, with breaks for snacks and cuddles. We go on field trips to the San Marcos River, where we splash around and cool off. We have pools and toys in the yards for cooling off and entertainment. We play mental games, like \"seek n find\". It is a sensory exercise where they use their best sense (nose) to find treasures (treats). I have 15+ years of vet tech experience and I am a lifelong animal Lover, dedicating time, love, energy and resources on rescuing, rehabilitating and rehoming pups. I offer daycare and shuttle services for your convenience. I promise to send them home tired. :)",
